From: macos-local PAuth cost research
Subject: [PATCH] Group QARMA cell and tweak permutations by displacement
Base-After: 0020-pauth-packed-qarma5-sbox.patch

Merge equal cell displacements modulo 64 using portable rotations and
fixed masks. Apply the original forward/inverse feedback only to the
same selected tweak cells, and remove the unused scalar cell helpers.
Keep substitutions, round structure, keys and authentication unchanged.

diff --git a/target/arm/tcg/pauth_helper.c b/target/arm/tcg/pauth_helper.c
--- a/target/arm/tcg/pauth_helper.c
+++ b/target/arm/tcg/pauth_helper.c
@@ -30,56 +30,34 @@
 
 static uint64_t pac_cell_shuffle(uint64_t i)
 {
-    uint64_t o = 0;
-
-    o |= extract64(i, 52, 4);
-    o |= extract64(i, 24, 4) << 4;
-    o |= extract64(i, 44, 4) << 8;
-    o |= extract64(i,  0, 4) << 12;
-
-    o |= extract64(i, 28, 4) << 16;
-    o |= extract64(i, 48, 4) << 20;
-    o |= extract64(i,  4, 4) << 24;
-    o |= extract64(i, 40, 4) << 28;
-
-    o |= extract64(i, 32, 4) << 32;
-    o |= extract64(i, 12, 4) << 36;
-    o |= extract64(i, 56, 4) << 40;
-    o |= extract64(i, 20, 4) << 44;
-
